sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator or CI
    participant CP as CDN control plane
    participant Edge as Edge nodes
    participant Shield as Origin shield
    participant Origin as Origin server

    Op->>CP: Purge API call for a cache key
    CP->>Edge: Invalidate the key at every edge
    Note over Edge: Propagation can take seconds to minutes
    Edge->>Shield: Next request for the key misses
    Shield->>Origin: Fetch the fresh object
    Origin-->>Shield: Fresh response
    Shield-->>Edge: Response stored at the edge
    Edge-->>Edge: Fresh copy served until the TTL expires
